title: "A triangulation framework for causal verification of genetic comorbidity: recalibrating insomnia–Alzheimer's disease"
abstract: "Analysis pipeline for triangulation-based Mendelian randomization framework applied to insomnia-AD comorbidity, including bidirectional MR, LDSC rg, coloc, two-step protein/metabolite mediation MR, MVMR, education PheWAS, and East Asian cross-ancestry replication."
